{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >!This game contains visual effects that may cause dizziness, disorientation, or seizures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're the LeBronze of the town; everyone is looking down on you. You\u2019ve got one last shot to prove you\u2019re the GOAT.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872200/extras/44ae1cd40cdef470960fcbac4233f908.poster.avif?t=1770153727\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872200/extras/44ae1cd40cdef470960fcbac4233f908.webm?t=1770153727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872200/extras/44ae1cd40cdef470960fcbac4233f908.mp4?t=1770153727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump your way to the top. If you fall just shoot the basketball and it will teleport you to its location. Get risky, shoot your way up, but the higher you go, the more you may lose.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872200/extras/f759d9e5ce03333a6159f1db8f9b720a.poster.avif?t=1770153727\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872200/extras/f759d9e5ce03333a6159f1db8f9b720a.webm?t=1770153727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872200/extras/f759d9e5ce03333a6159f1db8f9b720a.mp4?t=1770153727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use elements like slow-motion  to help you traverse object to object if you can't handle the speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872200/extras/9a31dd9e6fcee78aa0b67ebebe6e3ae7.avif?t=1770153727\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are checkpoints, but you\u2019ll have to earn them. Land in a telephone booth to activate a checkpoint and avoid restarting from the very beginning.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Star Boy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3872200/e97b4e79e0ff5bd7f57f86b310c0a3c2f32f06a9.jpg"},{"name":"Gold Boy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3872200/7c6f3e4be417cb7e25d8adbf0328b53d5e63aaf5.jpg"},{"name":"Silver Boy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3872200/706e97e1f458d4d2cacbb41f41b74ca9b9a8e650.jpg"},{"name":"Worlds Laughing Stock","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3872200/47ddab17f1cca64208642ae94d76a49b21949f6c.jpg"},{"name":"Back to Earth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3872200/d2cd7cdc153cf130c7236d4cdad961712e2c7102.jpg"},{"name":"PRO Gamer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3872200/9959a2be9ab16d995a35e23d7182ba8339bf09eb.jpg"},{"name":"Professional Clown","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3872200/07ae9049d0bf628584eb29eacad1b95b64b8eb1d.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3872200?t=1770153727","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3872200?t=1770153727","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872200/b33d9c31996ebc006ce91f675b0b858d2acd6f5c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770153727","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstat